      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCK IT ROGER (4) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 6 lengths at Mt Gambier in a handy 22.87. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well at this distance. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Great chance to get the job done again. CANYA KATSU (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (23.08). Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Should be about the mark. COOLIDGE (6) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when third (17.44) at Murray Bridge Straight in a Grade 6. Well placed here and should do much better. KOOKABURRA EMILY (8) cannot be underestimated.",
